{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-jet-horizon","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:jet-horizon","kind":"definition","title":"Jet horizon (degree-$0$ vanishing locus)","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-jet-planck-steps"],"tags":["jet-horizon","event-horizon","degree-zero","vanishing-ideal","information-barrier"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.JetHorizon","text":"jet-horizon.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:jet-horizon\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">U \\subset M_0</code> be an open subset of the descended universe carrying an affine chart, and let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A_0 \\hookrightarrow A_1 \\hookrightarrow A_2 \\hookrightarrow \\cdots</code> be the brane tower.</p>\n<p>A <strong>jet horizon</strong> in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">U</code> is a closed codimension-<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code> subset <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{H} \\subset U</code> such that every section of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A_0</code> extending continuously across <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{H}</code> vanishes on <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{H}</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\mathcal{H}\n  = \n  V\\!\\bigl(\\mathfrak{h}\\bigr),\n  \\qquad\n  \\mathfrak{h}\n  = \n  \\bigl\\{\n    s \\in \\Gamma(U, A_0)\n     : \n    s|_{\\mathcal{H}} = 0\n  \\bigr\\}.</code></pre>\n<p>The ideal <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{h} \\subset \\Gamma(U, A_0)</code> is the <strong>horizon ideal</strong>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/jet-horizon.md","heading":"Definition","number":"22.12.1","page":"b/def-jet-horizon","qa":{"counts":{"pass":83,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":9,"unknown":0,"stale":66},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.InformationTheory.JetHorizon","via":"ref","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/InformationTheory/JetHorizon.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
